# Data & fixtures (Blank)

## Two layers

1. **`internal/fixtures/`** — embedded `locale/*.json`, typed **`Locale`** in `fixtures.go`, **`LoadLocale(code)`** — **site shell and pages only**.
2. **Handlers** (`internal/site`) — resolve locale from context, build **`layout.Data`** via `layout.BuildData`, pass to page `*From` builders with **already-translated** strings.

## Dev overlay (separate)

- **`internal/devoverlay/fixtures/`** — own embedded locale JSON for the dev widget; not part of app `fixtures.Locale`.
- Overlay resolves locale per request in `devoverlay/locale.go` (same cookie/query rules as the site).
- See [`internal/devoverlay/README.md`](../../internal/devoverlay/README.md).

## Rules

- User-visible copy lives in **`locale/en.json`**, **`locale/ru.json`**, … — not hard-coded in `.templ`.
- Extend **`Locale`** + **every** locale file when adding new UI strings (theme labels, nav labels, page copy).
- **`internal/views`** and **`internal/ui/components`** take props only; no fixture imports in templ.
- Keep **accessible names** (aria labels, button titles) in fixtures when used as `aria-label`.

## Locale switching

- Header control: **`toggles.LanguageSwitch`** built in `site/feature.go` via **`locale.BuildLangHref`**.
- Framework cookie/query strategy is configured in `cmd/server/main.go` (`WithLocales`).

See **`blank-atomic-ui8px.mdc`** for presentation boundaries.
